# Next.js

- This project uses Next.js 16 — read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before assuming APIs.
- Use the App Router under `src/app`; colocate route `page.tsx`, `layout.tsx`, `loading.tsx` as needed.
- Build metadata with `createPageMetadata` / `buildMetadata` — do not hand-roll Open Graph repeatedly.
- Prefer static generation for marketing pages; use dynamic only when required.
- `output: "standalone"` is configured for Docker — keep that intact.
- Images: use `next/image` with configured `remotePatterns`.
